Site made with [Svelte](https://svelte.dev/). See full details [here](https://github.com/ndrewgood/ndrewgood-finch/blob/master/README.md).

Fonts used are [Nunito](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Nunito) and [Nunito Sans](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Nunito+Sans?query=Vernon+Adams).

Thank you [Carolyn](http://carolynlalonde.com/), [Josh](https://www.jkh.work/), and [Aida](https://aidarebek.com/) for design and strategy feedback!
